<title>HUNGARY: Budapest bourse turnover rises to HUF 10.209 bln.</title>
<headline>Budapest bourse turnover rises to HUF 10.209 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange's spot share turnover rose to 10.209 billion forints on Friday from 7.721 billion forints on Thursday, according to final figures.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsrogm +36 1 327-4040</p>
